            "block_content": "If APRA refuses an application by a body corporate or a group of \nindividual trustees for an RSE licence, APRA must take all.\nreasonable steps to ensure that the body or a member of the group \nis given a notice informing the body or group of:.\n(a) APRA's refusal of the application; and.\n\n(b) the reasons for that refusal;\nas soon as practicable after refusing the application.\n",
